      "content": "I can offer general advice on diversifying your asset holdings. Consider diversifying your liquid assets across different accounts and institutions to minimize the risk of consolidation. You may consider opening high-yield savings accounts, money market funds, or certificates of deposit (CDs) at different credit unions, banks, or online financial institutions. Additionally, consider using online banking and mobile banking apps to monitor your accounts and receive notifications, allowing you to spot any suspicious activity more easily.",
